<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Provisional machine alignment by Codex (English-first); GMR English remains verbatim and no hgm_gloss is changed. The repeated conduct, birth, and experience words are paired with their own higher- or lower-realm clauses. skyes bu dam pa and bde sdug retain two strictly tighter members apiece. lus has no separate bodily exponent. The negative half of myong mi myong and the rhetorical negation around med par remain unbanked because their English contribution is distributed.</div>
